Package: surveychat
Title: Adaptive Surveys and Forms with LLM Validation for 'shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dylan", "Pieper", , "dylanpieper@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collect survey data in 'shiny' with a chat, a form, or both,
    and let the user switch between them. One question spec drives both
    views. An LLM validates each answer against a plain-language rule,
    extracts structured data, and writes adaptive questions from earlier
    answers. Raw and extracted answers are stored on any 'DBI' backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dylanpieper/surveychat, https://dylanpieper.github.io/surveychat/
